  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "gdn_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -334
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Seasons garden\n\nFive L-system plants grow (Trim Path draws each one out, turtle order, as a State number climbs to 1), sway in the wind (each is sheared about its root by noise) and go through the year: leaves on every turtle vertex swell in spring, darken in summer, turn and drop in autumn — a particle emitter sheds them, blown by a Wind force — and in winter the branches stand bare while snow falls. The season sets the leaf, sky and ground colours (Gradient lookups) and the two emitters' rates.\n\n• Slider into `season` (0 spring … 4) with the toggle off; toggle on: a year every 48 s.\n• Slider into `wind`.  • Bang: replant (grow again).  • Vary: new plants.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 270
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Seasons garden\n\nFive L-system plants grow (Trim Path draws each one out, turtle order, as a State number climbs to 1), sway in the wind (each is sheared about its root by noise) and go through the year: leaves on every turtle vertex swell in spring, darken in summer, turn and drop in autumn — a particle emitter sheds them, blown by a Wind force — and in winter the branches stand bare while snow falls. The season sets the leaf, sky and ground colours (Gradient lookups) and the two emitters' rates.\n\n• Slider into `season` (0 spring … 4) with the toggle off; toggle on: a year every 48 s.\n• Slider into `wind`.  • Bang: replant (grow again).  • Vary: new plants.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 270
      }
    },
